  m_text: '<line-height=100%><color=#00C4CC><b><size=130%>07.</size> Why does option
    C often fail to score points?</b></color>


    <line-height=130%><indent=5%><size=95%>

    <color=#5EE2E8>A.</color>
    Because it has the highest probability.

    <color=#5EE2E8>B.</color> Because
    it is not evidence.

    <color=#5EE2E8>C.</color> Because it sounds too much
    like what a person really thinks.</size></indent></line-height>'
