  m_text: "<line-height=100%><color=#9966FF><b><size=130%>03.</size> When someone
    says, \u201CI like drawing,\u201D which sentence is closest to the real meaning?</b></color>\n\n<line-height=130%><indent=5%><size=95%>\n<color=#B38CFF>A.</color>
    She will definitely become an artist in the future.\n<color=#B38CFF>B.</color>
    She can like it, as long as it doesn\u2019t actually change her life.\n<color=#B38CFF>C.</color>
    She should immediately rename her rubber-stamp carving career as sculpture.</size></indent></line-height>"
