  m_text: "<line-height=100%><color=#0078FF><b><size=130%>01.</size> Is peach-flavored
    soft serve good?</b></color>\r\n\r\n<line-height=120%><indent=5%><size=90%>\r\n<color=#00A2FF>A.</color>
    Yes, it is good.\r\n<color=#00A2FF>B.</color> I don\u2019t want to buy it if
    there isn\u2019t a \u201Csecond one half price\u201D deal.\r\n<color=#00A2FF>C.</color>
    I never got to eat it, but it\u2019s not a big deal.\r\n</size></indent></line-height>"
